    narr:narration """The narrative trajectory for [decision capture at the point of consensus](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) has shifted from a conceptual product thesis in March 2026 to a performance-based validation by late July. The focus has moved from the abstract necessity of capturing artifacts to the empirical outcomes of specific feature deployments. The team [shipped the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785320401145_1) as a primary operational milestone, which is now being evaluated against [velocity metrics](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785320401145_2) and technical dependencies like the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785320401145_3). While the current discourse is heavily weighted toward quantifying success, the underlying tension remains in the attribution of these gains: whether the performance spike is a direct result of the new tooling or the broader technical infrastructure integration.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1785320401145_1> ;
